1. Definitions
================================================================================

"Licensor" means the copyright holder(s) of Qoin Maker.

"Software" means Qoin Maker and all accompanying source, templates,
documentation, and generated scaffolding contained in this repository,
excluding third-party components that carry their own licenses.

"You" means an individual or legal entity exercising permissions under
this license.

"Non-Production Use" means use solely for evaluation, education,
personal hobby projects that are not offered to paying customers,
research, or internal testing that does not result in a publicly
deployed token, product, or service.

"Production Use" means any use where the Software, or output generated
by the Software (including smart contracts, deployment scripts, or
white-label tools), is used to:

  (a) launch, market, or operate a token, coin, or digital asset for
      a business, community with commercial intent, or paying clients;
  (b) provide a hosted, SaaS, or agency service that wraps the Software;
  (c) embed the Software in a commercial product;
  (d) resell, sublicense, or white-label the Software; or
  (e) generate revenue, fundraising proceeds, or client fees that
      depend on the Software or its output.

"Change Date" means 26 September 2030.

"Change License" means Apache License, Version 2.0.

